<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sunny skies, cool temps.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sunny skies, cool temps.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Wednesday were forecast to see sunny skies and cool temperatures, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta was forecast to see mainly sunny skies with highs of -4 Celsius to +2 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan was forecast to see partly sunny skies with highs of -6 to -2 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba was forecast to see mainly sunny skies with highs of -8 to -4 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
